# Private keys / secrets — never commit.
# infra/gateway/README.md tells you to run `openssl genrsa -out platform-jwt.pem`
# inside infra/gateway/; that key MINTS tenant-scoped platform JWTs and is the
# entire tenant-isolation boundary, so it must never be committable.
*.pem
*.key
platform-jwt.pub

# Credential-shaped files. None of these matches anything tracked today; they are here so
# a contributor cannot commit one by accident.
credentials.json
token.json
service-account*.json
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
.npmrc
.netrc
.htpasswd

# Local tooling output
*.log
coverage.xml
